OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FMark Forrest showcases the best
OL,13,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,14,     Fbeyond, including a live concert
OL,15,     Ffrom mezzo-soprano Helen Charlston
OL,16,     Fand pianist Sholto Kynoch at
OL,17,     FWigmore Hall.
OL,18,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stan Tracey
OL,19,     F1/5. Kate Molleson is joined by
OL,20,     FClark Tracey to explore the life
OL,21,     Fand work of his father, pianist
OL,22,     Fand composer Stan Tracey.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
