OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FPianist Paul Lewis chats to Katie
OL,7,     Fahead of concerts in Bath and
OL,8,     FLondon. Tony nominated singer Ann
OL,9,     FHampton Callaway performs songs by
OL,10,     FCole Porter.
OL,11,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,12,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,14,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,15,     FDvorak, Louise Farrenc and
OL,16,     FArcangelo Corelli.
OL,17,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,18,     FUnder the baton of Daniel Hyde,
OL,19,     Fthe BBC Singers and the Orchestra
OL,20,     Fof the Age of Enlightenment
OL,21,     Fperform Handel's Dixit dominus and
OL,22,     FMozart's 'Great' Mass in C minor.
