OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto is back with another week
OL,7,     Fof the best in jazz from the UK
OL,8,     Fand around the world, and he
OL,9,     Fwelcomes his Flowers guest this
OL,10,     Fweek, Haitian-American vocalist
OL,11,     FTyreek McDole.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FRenaud Capucon with Julia Hagen
OL,14,     Fand Guillaume Bellom play
OL,15,     FSchubert's Piano Trio No 1. After
OL,16,     Fthis, Gerard Causse and Lorraine
OL,17,     FCampet join for Schubert's Trout
OL,18,     FQuintet.
